WEBVTT

00:00:00.385 --> 00:00:01.204
DAD, LOOK,
HARRY'S GOT A LETTER!

00:00:01.248 --> 00:00:02.902
HEY, GIVE IT BACK!
IT'S MINE!

00:00:02.945 --> 00:00:05.861
YOURS?
WHO'D BE WRITING TO YOU?

00:00:13.782 --> 00:00:15.392
[GULP]

00:00:25.054 --> 00:00:27.753
[SCREECHING]

00:00:34.107 --> 00:00:37.066
[DRILL WHIRRING]

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:41.201
Vernon: ...LETTER BOX.

00:00:41.244 --> 00:00:43.595
[CREAKING]

00:00:43.638 --> 00:00:45.597
[DRILL WHIRRING]

00:00:48.817 --> 00:00:50.819
[SCREECHING]

00:00:53.039 --> 00:00:56.477
Petunia: HAVE A LOVELY DAY
AT THE OFFICE, DEAR.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:58.261
[OWLS SCREECHING]

00:00:59.262 --> 00:01:02.004
SHOO! GO ON!

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:26.638
[SIGHS]

00:01:26.681 --> 00:01:29.945
FINE DAY, SUNDAY.

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:32.556
IN MY OPINION,
BEST DAY OF THE WEEK.

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:34.123
WHY IS THAT, DUDLEY?

00:01:35.168 --> 00:01:37.300
'CAUSE THERE'S
NO POST ON SUNDAYS?

00:01:37.344 --> 00:01:39.302
RIGHT YOU ARE, HARRY.

00:01:39.346 --> 00:01:41.740
NO POST ON SUNDAYS. HA!

00:01:43.524 --> 00:01:46.701
Vernon:
NO BLASTED LETTERS TODAY!

00:01:46.745 --> 00:01:51.140
NO, SIR! NOT ONE
SINGLE BLOODY LETTER!

00:01:51.184 --> 00:01:52.707
NOT ONE!

00:01:52.751 --> 00:01:54.535
[OWLS CHITTERING]

00:02:01.934 --> 00:02:06.025
NO, SIR! NOT ONE
BLASTED, MISERABLE--

00:02:08.114 --> 00:02:09.898
[FLUTTERING]

00:02:09.942 --> 00:02:11.944
[RUMBLING]

00:02:16.339 --> 00:02:19.778
Dudley: AAH! MAKE IT STOP!
PLEASE MAKE IT STOP!

00:02:21.431 --> 00:02:22.911
STOP IT! STOP IT!

00:02:22.955 --> 00:02:24.304
WHAT IS IT?!

00:02:24.347 --> 00:02:27.437
[PETUNIA SCREAMING]

00:02:27.481 --> 00:02:29.135
Dudley: PLEASE TELL ME
WHAT'S HAPPENING!

00:02:29.178 --> 00:02:33.139
Vernon:
GO AWAY! AAH!

00:02:33.182 --> 00:02:35.141
GIVE ME THAT!

00:02:35.184 --> 00:02:38.231
GIVE ME THAT LETTER!

00:02:40.363 --> 00:02:41.364
GET OFF!

00:02:41.408 --> 00:02:44.498
AAH!
AAH!

00:02:44.541 --> 00:02:45.673
AAH!

00:02:45.717 --> 00:02:49.808
THEY'RE MY LETTERS!
LET GO OF ME!

00:02:51.157 --> 00:02:54.334
THAT'S IT!
WE'RE GOING AWAY!

00:02:54.377 --> 00:02:56.466
FAR AWAY!

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:58.773
WHERE THEY CAN'T FIND US!

00:02:58.817 --> 00:03:01.167
DADDY'S GONE MAD,
HASN'T HE?

00:03:04.039 --> 00:03:06.041
[THUNDER]

00:03:33.677 --> 00:03:36.593
[BEEPING]

00:03:36.637 --> 00:03:38.421
MAKE A WISH, HARRY.

00:03:39.553 --> 00:03:41.381
[BLOWS]

00:03:41.424 --> 00:03:43.426
[BANG]

00:03:44.601 --> 00:03:45.689
[BANG]

00:03:47.039 --> 00:03:48.605
[BANG]

00:03:49.911 --> 00:03:51.870
[BANG]

00:03:51.913 --> 00:03:54.611
[BANG]

00:03:54.655 --> 00:03:56.135
WHO'S THERE?

00:03:56.178 --> 00:03:57.614
[BANG]

00:03:58.572 --> 00:04:00.661
AAH!
AAH!

00:04:09.148 --> 00:04:10.510
SORRY ABOUT THAT.

